# SkiaSharp's native build links its own FreeType, libjpeg and libpng statically; it is upstream's
# binary (SkiaSharp.NativeAssets.Linux) and cannot use the system copies without rebuilding Skia.
# Fixes to them arrive with SkiaSharp updates (D036).
memory-map: embedded-library freetype [usr/lib/memory-map/libSkiaSharp.so]
memory-map: embedded-library libjpeg [usr/lib/memory-map/libSkiaSharp.so]
memory-map: embedded-library libpng [usr/lib/memory-map/libSkiaSharp.so]
